<title>USA: Earthgrains Co Q3 Dec 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Earthgrains Co Q3 Dec 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.91     loss	$ 0.91</p>
<p> Net profit		 9,200     loss	 9,300</p>
<p> Revs		     522,700		  524,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,100		   10,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 net excludes pre-tax charge of $7.8 million from work force reduction program in Europe, and pre-tax gain of $400,000 from restructuring and sale of a non-core business.  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	     $  1.48     loss	$ 2.06</p>
<p> Net profit		14,900     loss	21,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,275,000		1,292,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,100		   10,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months net excludes one-time charge for restructuring and closing a facility of $600,000.</p>
<p>1995 nine months loss excludes charges from restructuring and from European work force reduction.</p>
</text>
